abstract: >-
  SocioFM is an open family of compact causal language models trained on
  structured societal event streams. The software release provides the data
  pipeline, chronological benchmarking framework, model training code,
  downstream evaluation, geographic and media audits, calibration analyses,
  statistical inference, and reproducible manuscript visualizations.
